pack.name=Enhanced Survival - Resources
pack.description=Hardcore survival addon! Stronger mobs, faster hunger, deadly creepers!

## Enhanced Mobs
## Zombie: 25 HP, breaks doors, sees 35 blocks
## Spider: Poisonous bite (8 sec)
## Skeleton: 24 HP, faster shooting
## Creeper: 25 HP, faster explosion (0.8s), bigger radius
## Wolf (tamed): 30 HP, 8 damage - powerful protector
## Phantom: 30-45 HP, 8-14 damage, aggressive
## Enderman: 60 HP, 10 damage
## Witch: 36 HP, throws potions faster
## Drowned: 28 HP, poisonous attack
## Pillager: 32 HP, faster shooting
## Vindicator: 36 HP, 15 damage, very fast
## Evoker: 32 HP, more fangs
## Wither Skeleton: 28 HP, 12 sec wither effect
## Ghast: Sees 100 blocks, accurate shots
## Blaze: 28 HP, 5 fireballs burst
## Guardian: 40 HP, stronger laser
## Zombified Piglin: 28 HP, 12 damage, stays angry 45 sec

## Survival Changes
## Hunger depletes 1.5-2x faster
## Insomnia starts after 2 days
## Ore drops reduced by 25-30%
